# Design taste

Do not ship the default AI look: cream canvas + serif hero + terracotta,
Inter/Plus Jakarta + `slate-*`/`blue-600`, equal rounded cards with soft
shadows, ALL-CAPS eyebrows, middle-dot meta (`A · B · C`), or buttons
ending in `→` / `Learn more →`.

Each SPA already has a locked identity. Load it and obey it:

- `dispensary` → `.cursor/skills/react-story/dispensary.md` (shop floor)
- `admin` → `.cursor/skills/react-story/admin.md` (HQ / platform)

Use `@theme` tokens (`bg-canvas`, `text-ink`, `bg-brand`, `border-line`).
Never `slate-500`, `emerald-600`, `sky-600`, or `blue-600` on new UI.

## Layout

- Dispensary: dense tables and forms, tight type, left brand rail. Speed.
- Admin: scan many tenants, hairline dark chrome, serif wordmark. Oversight.
- Do not clone one app into the other with a theme swap.

## Motion and charts

- One deliberate reveal per route (auth panel or page header). No fade-up
  on every card. Honor `prefers-reduced-motion`.
- Micro-interactions: `motion/react` only. Do not add GSAP, Lenis, Rive, or
  Lottie unless a story ships designer assets.
- Charts: Recharts through that app's `AreaMetricChart` (or equivalent),
  colored from tokens. Empty state before fake series.

## Primitives

Restyle Radix in `src/components/atoms`. Do not paste stock shadcn New York
chrome. Lucide only — no emoji icons. 21st.dev/Magic is for pattern
reference; restyle to this app's tokens before commit.

## Done means seen

Screenshot the changed flow (browser tools or Playwright MCP). Critique
hierarchy, contrast, density, and generic tells. Fix, then re-screenshot.
A single pretty render is not done.
